      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "It looks like your avatar has multiple gameobject hierarchies present in it. This can occur when the main hierarchy has _any_ reference to other hierarchies in the scene, unity very readily will mark them as a dependency and include them within the final asset bundle.\n\nI would go and check in the avatar descriptor, physbones, contacts, etc. to see if there's something referenced which is on another hierarchy. Doing this likely will also notably reduce the size of your avatar.\n\nAfter you have done this please respond to this message with how it went, if there are still issues I can investigate further.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
